de police 2"},{"id":3726352,"name":"Thibaud Vaneck","role":"L'avocat","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rpIgbNUaKRBmoe1t6ei2i9mXNyD.jpg"},{"id":5403592,"name":"Dylan Pedron","role":"Frédéric, l'assistant de Louise"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"My Dog Stupid - Il mio cane Stupido","overview":"Henri è nel bel mezzo di una crisi di mezza età. Addossa la responsabilità dei suoi fallimenti, della sua mancanza di desiderio e del suo mal di schiena alla moglie e ai quattro figli. In un momento in cui rivaluta tutta la sua esistenza, le donne che non avrà più e le macchine che non guiderà mai, un enorme cane, minaccioso e intemperante, decide di stabilirsi nella sua abitazione. Mentre Henri non potrebbe essere più che felice, il resto della famiglia e, in particolar modo, la moglie Cecile inizieranno a mal tollerare la situazione."},{"language":"en-US","title":"My Dog Stupid","overview":"Henri is a middle-aged writer with fading inspiration who has published nothing worthy of note in years. Feeling increasingly misunderstood by his wife and four grown up deadbeat kids, he dreams of running away to start over again. Yet when he discovers an unattractive, bad-mannered dog in his garden, he decides to adopt him and both start developing an unexpected friendship that inevitably upsets Henri’s family and neighbors.","tagline":"You Don't Choose Your Family, Or Your Dog."},{"language":"fr-FR","title":"Mon Chien Stupide","overview":"Henri est en pleine crise de la cinquantaine. Les responsables de ses échecs, de son manque de libido et de son mal de dos ? Sa femme et ses quatre enfants, évidemment !  A l’heure où il fait le bilan critique de sa vie, de toutes les femmes qu’il n’aura plus, des voitures qu’il ne conduira pas, un énorme chien mal élevé et obsédé, décide de s’installer dans la maison, pour son plus grand bonheur mais au grand dam du reste de la famille et surtout de Cécile, sa femme dont l’amour indéfectible commence à se fissurer.","tagline":"Vous ne choisissez pas votre famille ou votre chien."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/huUruJNx0c4DhOURK0Jg3kXmX6o.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ad8fgh4JYGXkPHPW7IwCKrNXuFA.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":536506,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/huUruJNx0c4DhOURK0Jg3kXmX6o.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/huUruJNx0c4DhOURK0Jg3kXmX6o.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/huUruJNx0c4DhOURK0Jg3kXmX6o.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/huUruJNx0c4DhOURK0Jg3kXmX6o.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bObDrMrpJz6rVbM1vk21QkEvOPe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bObDrMrpJz6rVbM1vk21QkEvOPe.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bObDrMrpJz6rVbM1vk21QkEvOPe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bObDrMrpJz6rVbM1vk21QkEvOPe.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1KslnvegChYSHfIaCgF4av19J9D.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1KslnvegChYSHfIaCgF4av19J9D.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g3UIKwtk1cWuFPr6Xq9sTrE73g2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g3UIKwtk1cWuFPr6Xq9sTrE73g2.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/95zUVeh3R2BXaHKGu0JZytow4Dl.jpg","previewUrl":